# Altaeron

> Altaeron sells foot-care products, adjustable knee support, and foot-and-ankle massage devices for everyday support and comfort.

This is a curated guide to Altaeron's public catalog and support resources, checked on November 13, 2026. Product descriptions reflect the benefits and positioning advertised on the linked PDPs. Consult those pages for current prices, availability, delivery options, instructions, and policy terms.

## Products

- [Altaeron™ Adjustable Bunion Corrector](https://altaeron.com/products/adjustable-bunion-corrector): For crooked or misaligned big toes, crowded toes, and painful bunion bumps. PDP headline: “Straighten Your Big Toe. Reduce the Bunion Bump.” Advertised benefits: “Corrects big toe misalignment” and “Relieves bunion pain and discomfort.” Precision-adjustable dial and hinge support; use on either foot.
- [Altaeron™ DialFit Knee Brace](https://altaeron.com/products/dialfit-knee-brace): Fine-tune knee support in seconds to reduce strain, absorb impact and move with more confidence. For walking, stairs, workouts, and long standing or walking shifts. Cushioned patella support and flexible side stabilization without a bulky brace. Adjust while wearing it.
- [Altaeron™ AirRelief Foot & Ankle Massager](https://altaeron.com/products/airrelief-foot-ankle-massager): Helps reduce swelling, stiffness & end-of-day foot pain. Air compression, warming heat and vibration surround tired feet and ankles to ease aching pressure, loosen tightness and help that heavy, puffy feeling melt away. Cordless 15-minute relief while you sit, work or unwind. Three compression cycles, five intensities, four heat levels, and four vibration levels.
- [Toe Alignment Socks](https://altaeron.com/products/toe-alignment-socks): Beige open-toe foot sleeves with a big-toe loop, as pictured. No product-specific written benefit claims or instructions are published.

